abstract: >-
  Binary Review Swarm (BRS) is a provider-agnostic validation architecture for
  AI-generated artifacts. It applies explicit atomic checks, fail-closed veto,
  localized bounded repair, mandatory full revalidation, and a final
  RELEASE/BLOCK decision.
